Package: tekne-nvidia-repo
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: NVIDIA's APT repository, for tekne-nvidia (opt-in)
 Adds NVIDIA's Debian 13 repository, which tekne-nvidia installs NVIDIA's
 display driver from. Its signing key is scoped to that repository with
 Signed-By, and an APT pin admits only the driver's own source packages:
 nothing else NVIDIA publishes (CUDA included) can be installed from it.
 .
 Install this, run "apt update", then install tekne-nvidia. Systems
 without it never contact NVIDIA's server.
